{"text": " You wake up in 1763 in a village in Prussia. It's autumn. The war's just over. The harvest's in. And the pastor has news from the king. Did you know that Frederick the great's new school law banned school holidays? Not even at harvest time. So what is school now? In order, from the king. Every boy and girl from fountains until about 13. Skip it and your parents can be fined. In winter, you're in class from 8 to 11 in 1 to 4. In summer, just a few hours because there are cows to herd. The law even says hire a shepherd so the children can go to school. Your teacher might be an old soldier. Many early village teachers were. You might have heard school was invented to make obedient factory workers. Historians say it's not that simple. Prussia was still a land of farms. The king and his church wanted loyal, god-fearing discipline subjects. And plenty of families just ignored the rules. But one teacher per village is slow and expensive. In London, a young man thinks he can teach the poor for almost nothing. His trick? Make the children the teachers.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.22, "text": " You wake up in 1763 in a village in Prussia.", "tokens": [50364, 509, 6634, 493, 294, 3282, 29491, 294, 257, 7288, 294, 2114, 39942, 13, 50560], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20520846583262212, "compression_ratio": 1.5263157894736843, "no_speech_prob": 0.005189663730561733, "words": [{"word": " You", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.14, "probability": 0.8147623538970947}, {"word": " wake", "start": 0.14, "end": 0.32, "probability": 0.9949245452880859}, {"word": " up", "start": 0.32, "end": 0.56, "probability": 0.9993195533752441}, {"word": " in", "start": 0.56, "end": 0.7, "probability": 0.9970371723175049}, {"word": " 1763", "start": 0.7, "end": 2.02, "probability": 0.9891541600227356}, {"word": " in", "start": 2.02, "end": 2.34, "probability": 0.971351146697998}, {"word": " a", "start": 2.34, "end": 2.42, "probability": 0.9933871626853943}, {"w